NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003152 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003153 "=head1 AUTHOR"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003154 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003155 "Kip Hampton (khampton@totalcinema.com) did most of the work, after porting"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003156 "it from XML::Filter::Base."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003157 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003158 "Robin Berjon (robin@knowscape.com) pitched in with patches to make it "
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003159 "usable as a base for drivers as well as filters, along with other patches."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003160 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003161 "Matt Sergeant (matt@sergeant.org) wrote the original XML::Filter::Base,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003162 "and patched a few things here and there, and imported it into"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00003163 "the XML::SAX distribution."
